{
  "id": "c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Taking risks for thrills",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you feel about taking risks?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you ever been really scared during an activity?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what would be your idea of a perfect adventure?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think people today are more or less cautious than previous generations?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e30-a1",
            "c1-e30-a2",
            "c1-e30-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people taking part in dangerous sports. Choose two of the pictures and say why the people might want to do these activities, and what risks they are taking.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these activities would you find most frightening?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e30-b1",
            "c1-e30-b2",
            "c1-e30-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people affected by risky activities. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be feeling, and what the consequences of taking these risks could be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, who should be responsible when something goes wrong?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some reasons why people take part in extreme sports, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these reasons explain why people choose extreme sports?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the strongest motive?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about risk and extreme sports.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should extreme sports be regulated more strictly?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent is the media responsible for encouraging risky behaviour?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think the cost of rescues should be paid by those who need to be rescued?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it possible to live a full life without taking any risks?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, what can people learn from facing danger?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, are people who take big risks more successful in life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e30-taking-risks-for-thrills/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
